ID), FOREIGN KEY (LastRaceTrackID) REFERENCES Races_Tracks (TrackID), FOREIGN KEY (LastWinTrackID) REFERENCES Races_Tracks (TrackID), FOREIGN KEY (SeasonID) REFERENCES Seasons (SeasonID) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE, FOREIGN KEY (StaffID) REFERENCES Staff_DriverData (StaffID) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE);

